      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13acd8579e9259875ccd2a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "祈祷，期盼，\n只是等着奇迹和幸运的到来——",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a7d4fa2427b78d0f8b38e78a653acbe191bdf2bf9ecca0ddcb3e6742d9437d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66f836fbadb3960985661555",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样的事，她有做过哪怕一次吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "37769a4302d24314146af556f741c41a204c81b2db876b9d630d44ffdcabe0c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760e10cc77c46c9e78ad346e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不管遇到什么样的困难，什么样的障碍。\n她——莱茵力量，总是会\n用她的双手，用她的双腿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3f137fde7c0cfd7a7e291c156238ac422493658849b5bffb0790a291d247b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58ca8d99ba610356d557fa08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧紧地攥在手中……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d988c857345f81e82e795b73bb931a09ae7dc0e5face74c355c84985fba75ddf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3350137bbffe59ee1362ba48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在梦想的前方，将幸运和奇迹——",
      "source_fingerprint": "baec1782c94d580277127f10cbbead11ea4383b649dd6dee7368ec4ca938f964",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250dde3a0a2bb9e38b8a49cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我再次摇了摇头。\n然后，用力擦去了眼角那不争气泪水，\n之后便跑了出去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9686b6fd5e677cbdf6077748b33f4269e95ed1e42edee7581b4a9bd4b330fce4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:064f7fe522c8147cd54ed536",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "行人B",
