    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673e299b94b74a5f0ba6c7e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不是……　……是莱茵力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e2d8df3a96b6e6f788efee4a581398856c3474cb70e0d9b995feaba2a8c7c78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d7bbc441a35fd5b612914f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我绝对……会让你醒过来的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f54ccb2a7e82eefd5ef2f59300f38bf33082abd46cc23be2442b4713207fa237",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0fc6bff84fd1168c198c358",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下定决心后。剩下的就是行动了。\n……时间只剩一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b48720251b95ffa3c68ec70e774ea44df524bd22d38f39cbee9b5b76beb6977c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060280a10f31e82612a964bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是便打起精神，\n出发了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8925ede0dead3a3768b5af0b9492091c5b4518034ec3b5036487c8cc16001ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f6c0c5a3883afc2686ba55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想……和莱茵说几句话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72915524071439668c13d13100c5bb1a2a9965148b78b0258567beee57ca7c9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
